+## Product/platform model
+
+Inventory Box is one product with two separate platform implementations:
+
+- Android Inventory Box — owned by Android chat/workflow
+- Windows Inventory Box — owned by PC/Codex agent
+
+Share product intent and interoperability contracts, not platform-specific source code.
+
+Do not reorganize, move, rename, or rewrite the working Android project merely to create a cleaner cross-platform directory layout.
